"SettingsView.48" = "One-time quests";
"SettingsView.49" = "No deadline. Complete it once to move it out of your list. History and points stay. Undo the entry to bring it back. Archived or deleted quests stay that way.";
"SettingsView.50" = "Recording time zone";
"SettingsView.51" = "\nYour original time zone stays the same. Weekly and monthly periods don't change when you travel.";
"SettingsView.52" = "Weeks start Monday at midnight";
"SettingsView.53" = "A new week starts Monday at midnight. Until Monday at 9 AM, you can choose 'Record last week' when completing a quest. The default is this week.";
