"SettingsView.55" = "Monthly goals restart on the first day of each month at midnight. There is no grace period for monthly entries.";
"SettingsView.56" = "Five parameters";
"SettingsView.57" = "Stamina · Knowledge · Perseverance · Charm · Courage\nYou decide which actions build which parameters. Assign up to 2 points per completion.";
"SettingsView.58" = "Perseverance grows with you";
"SettingsView.59" = "Meet the same quest's weekly goal 2 weeks in a row for Perseverance +1. Each consecutive week adds +1. Monthly quests work the same way, starting with the second consecutive month. One-time quests have no streak bonus.";
"SettingsView.60" = "The pentagon and the numbers";
"SettingsView.61" = "The pentagon shows growth in each parameter. Its scale is a visual guide. Free mode shows up to 99 per parameter while further growth is saved. Unlock CHALLENGE to reveal all your earned points.";
"SettingsView.62" = "Archiving and deleting";
"SettingsView.63" = "Archived quests can be restored. Deleted quests cannot. Both keep your completed actions and earned parameters.";
